.TH HEIMDALL\-DAEMON 1 "2026-10-29" "unheaded 158367ea" "Unheaded Kingdom"
.SH NAME
heimdall\-daemon \- Heimdall: watch this host for drift from the Mjölnir baseline and publish signed drift events; alerts only, never restores (ADR\-043).
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B heimdall\-daemon
[\fIOPTION\fR]...
.SH DESCRIPTION
Heimdall: watch this host for drift from the Mjölnir baseline and publish signed drift events; alerts only, never restores (ADR\-043).
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B \-\-allow\-unsigned
load a manifest without verifying a seal (lab runs only)
.TP
.B \-\-bpf\-dir \fISTRING\fR
directory with the heimdall\-bpf objects: attach vfs_write/execve hooks (event\-driven scans); needs CAP_BPF
.TP
.B \-\-cluster \fIN\fR
this node's Gjallarhorn cluster ID; reverify horns for other clusters are ignored (default 1)
.TP
.B \-\-drift\-sign\-key \fISTRING\fR
ML\-DSA\-65 seed (0600) that signs drift events; must not be the \-\-sign\-key or \-\-pubkey key
.TP
.B \-\-manifest \fISTRING\fR
Path to Mjölnir manifest (default references/baseline/mjolnir.example.yaml)
.TP
.B \-\-metrics\-addr \fISTRING\fR
serve GET /metrics here (drift publish counters, scan duration); empty disables (default 127.0.0.1:19101)
.TP
.B \-\-node\-id \fISTRING\fR
Node identifier (defaults to hostname)
.TP
.B \-\-pprof \fIADDR\fR
serve net/http/pprof on this loopback ADDR (e.g. 127.0.0.1:6060); off when empty
.TP
.B \-\-pubkey \fISTRING\fR
ML\-DSA\-65 public key file: verify <manifest>.seal before trusting the manifest
.TP
.B \-\-publish\-queue \fIN\fR
drift events held for Wotan before the oldest is dropped (default 256)
.TP
.B \-\-scan\-interval \fIDURATION\fR
Baseline scan interval (default 30s)
.TP
.B \-\-sign\-key \fISTRING\fR
sign \-\-manifest with this private key seed, write <manifest>.seal, exit
.TP
.B \-\-sign\-ttl \fIDURATION\fR
how long a seal written by \-\-sign\-key stays valid (default 720h0m0s)
.TP
.B \-\-wotan\-grpc \fISTRING\fR
Wotan gRPC address: publish each drift alert to drift.detected.<node\-id>, signed (UNHEADED_GRPC_TLS=1 for TLS)
.TP
.B \-\-xdp\-iface \fISTRING\fR
attach the observe\-only Gjallarhorn XDP program here (needs \-\-bpf\-dir)
.TP
.B \-\-xdp\-mode \fISTRING\fR
XDP attach mode: generic | native (default generic)
.TP
.B \-h, \-\-help
display this help and exit
.TP
.B \-V, \-\-version
output version information and exit
.SH EXAMPLES
.EX
heimdall\-daemon \-\-manifest /etc/unheaded/mjolnir.manifest.json \-\-pubkey /etc/unheaded/keys/mimir.pub
heimdall\-daemon \-\-xdp\-iface eth0 \-\-drift\-sign\-key /etc/unheaded/keys/drift.key
.EE
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR unheaded (1)
